cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the forecast, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Poengkart: Open Admission Thresholds and a Calibrated Forecast for the Norwegian Upper-Secondary Intake"
authors:
  - given-names: Abshalom
    family-names: Dayan
url: "https://poengkart.no"
repository-code: "https://github.com/avshalomd/poengkart"
license: MIT
version: "1.29"
date-released: 2026-10-21
abstract: >-
  Admission thresholds (poenggrenser) for Norwegian upper secondary schools:
  the points of the last applicant admitted to each programme at each school,
  per year and intake round, 2012-2026, collected from the counties' own
  publications, older years from newspaper and archive copies, and keyed to
  the national programme register (Grep). With a calibrated forecast of the
  next intake. The technical report is at https://poengkart.no/report.
keywords:
  - admission thresholds
  - upper secondary school
  - Norway
  - education
  - open data
  - forecasting
